          "title": "SQL injection in /api/search?q=",
          "severity": "CRITICAL",
          "description": "The `q` parameter is concatenated into a SQL query.\n\nAn unauthenticated attacker can read any table, including `users.password_hash`.",
          "impact": "Full read access to the application database.",
          "recommendation": "Use parameterised queries.\n\n1. Replace string concatenation in `SearchRepository`.\n2. Add a regression test.",
